# Spring FrameWork
-> Spring FrameWork is a set of tools that helps JavaDevelopers to build Applications faster and more easily.
-> It Provides a ready to use Structure of your Code.
-> You don't need to write everthing from scratch.

why do DEvelopers use Spring?
-> Write a less Code.
-> Automatically connect different parts of the Object.
-> Communicate with database Using Simple Code.
-> Get Help with common problems like error handling, Security and more

*****
Spring is a light-weigth Java Framwork use to build enterprise level Applications
-> It Provides complete InfraStructure Support for developing Java application and help you write clean loosely coupled and maintainable code.
-> Spring Frameworks is like a manager.

NOTE:- Spring divided into small small module.

*** Spring BENEFITS:-
1. object creation
2. Dependency Injection
3. Manage Configuration
4. Data Integration
5. Handling WEbREQ & Security.

